          "id": "cac409cf8fefcd76c2d126b22523c84706a925ef",
          "message": "skip tests of phi3v (#127)\n\n`AttributeError: module transformers has no attribute\r\nPhi3VImageProcessor` is showing up for most of the tests in\r\ntest_phi3v.py. I found a newly reported bug against transformers that\r\nlooks similar: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/issues/34307\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a new TestGroup for Phi3v and disables tests for that group\r\nin all `test_skip_env_vars/*.txt` files.\r\nThe group can be re-enabled in an appropriate file after the\r\ntransformers issue has been resolved.",
